# FastAPI Conventions — ${repo_name}

> ${rendered_notice}

## Route layer

- Prefer `APIRouter` with explicit `prefix` and `tags` as the app grows.
- Keep business logic out of route handlers; delegate to modules.
- Keep `GET /v1/health` (or `/healthz`) cheap and unauthenticated.
- This is **not** a Gate worker — do not require `GATE_URL` or constellation-node-sdk.

## Hygiene

- Do not use `print()` in `src/`; use logging if needed.
- Do not add OpenTelemetry Python packages by default; optional obs is compose-only.

## Runtime

- App entrypoint: `${app_entrypoint}`
- Package name: `${package_name}`
